  "identityHelp": "The file holds your identity, name, home, contacts and the nodes you paired with, and your messages if you tick the box. Your password locks it: without it nobody can open the file, not even you.\n\nOn the new phone, tap Restore from a file, then pair with your nodes again: a pairing stays on the phone it was made on. Your home keeps your mail meanwhile, and you can fetch it from any other node.\n\nUse one phone at a time: two phones with one identity would each take mail the other never sees.\n\nYour 12 words bring back your identity alone.",
